Use cWebSessionManagerStandard.pkg
Use SSO\cSsoState_mixin.pkg

Class cSsoWebSessionManager is a cWebSessionManagerStandard
    Procedure Construct_Object
        Forward Send Construct_Object
        
        Send Define_cSsoState_mixin
    End_Procedure
    
    Import_Class_Protocol cSsoState_mixin
    
    { MethodType=Event }
    // Function that maps a sso subject 
    Function MapSsoUserInfoToLocalUser String sProviderId tSsoUserInfo UserInfo Returns String
        Error DFERR_PROGRAM "This method (cSsoWebSessionManager.MapSsoSubToLocalUser) must be overridden."
    End_Function
    
